{
  "assumptions": [
    "The ECDC dictionary does not say whether hospital occupancy includes ICU patients, so both variants are declared and run (ADR-011 D30-04-3).",
    "Capacities are set above every population, so capacity never binds. No result supports a claim about capacity limits.",
    "The intervention intensity is a constant 0 with compliance 0. It is a modelling parameter, not an observed policy, and no result supports a claim about any real intervention.",
    "The immune share is 0 and its effect is absorbed by transmission. No result supports a claim about immunity.",
    "Rates are fixed across countries and across the whole period. Changes from vaccination, variants, testing and care are not modelled.",
    "Denominators are Eurostat population on 1 January. Values flagged by Eurostat as provisional, estimated or a break in series are used as published.",
    "A task whose initial state cannot be derived takes the persistence fallback of ADR-011 D30-04-4, counted and never dropped.",
    "Every value of the grid was chosen from the cited literature and the ADRs, without inspecting any outcome value of this dataset."
